<% content_for :title, "Terms of Service — TrustShip" %>

<article class="print:bg-white">
  <header class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Last updated: June 2025</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 text-sm print:hidden" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">On this page</p>
    <ol class="mt-4 grid list-decimal gap-x-8 gap-y-2 pl-5 text-gray-700 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#introduction" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Introduction</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#who-can-use" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Who Can Use TrustShip</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#what-trustship-does" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">What TrustShip Does</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#what-trustship-does-not" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">What TrustShip Does NOT Do</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#whatsapp-meta" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">WhatsApp Integration &amp; Meta Policies</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#data" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Your Data &amp; Your Buyers&apos; Data</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#early-access-pricing" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Early Access &amp; Pricing</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#acceptable-use" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Acceptable Use</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#service-availability" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Service Availability</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#limitation-of-liability" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Limitation of Liability</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#termination" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Termination</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#changes-to-terms" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Changes to Terms</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#governing-law" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Governing Law</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#contact" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Contact</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="mt-12 space-y-12 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
    <section id="introduction" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Welcome to TrustShip. By creating an account and using our platform, you agree to these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        TrustShip is a technology platform that helps WhatsApp sellers automatically capture, parse, and verify orders. We are not a logistics company, courier service, or shipping aggregator.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="who-can-use" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">2. Who Can Use TrustShip</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>You must be 18 years or older.</li>
        <li>You must be a legitimate business seller and comply with applicable laws in your jurisdiction.</li>
        <li>You must have a valid WhatsApp Business number.</li>
        <li>You must provide accurate business information during signup.</li>
        <li>TrustShip reserves the right to reject or terminate accounts that violate these terms.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="what-trustship-does" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">3. What TrustShip Does</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Connects to your WhatsApp Business number via Meta&apos;s official API.</li>
        <li>Reads incoming messages to identify and parse order information.</li>
        <li>Runs automated verification checks on orders.</li>
        <li>Sends WhatsApp messages to your buyers for order confirmation.</li>
        <li>Provides an order management dashboard.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        TrustShip does <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-800">not</strong> handle physical shipping, payments between seller and buyer, or logistics operations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="what-trustship-does-not" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">4. What TrustShip Does NOT Do</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>TrustShip is not responsible for shipping, delivery, or courier operations.</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not handle cash on delivery payments.</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not guarantee delivery of any shipment.</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not mediate disputes between sellers and their buyers.</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not provide refunds for shipping costs or lost shipments.</li>
        <li>Shipping is entirely the seller&apos;s responsibility.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="whatsapp-meta" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">5. WhatsApp Integration &amp; Meta Policies</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>By connecting your WhatsApp number to TrustShip, you agree to Meta&apos;s WhatsApp Business API Terms of Service.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for ensuring your use of WhatsApp via TrustShip complies with Meta&apos;s policies.</li>
        <li>TrustShip sends automated messages to your buyers — you are responsible for ensuring your buyers have opted in to receive such messages.</li>
        <li>TrustShip cannot be held responsible for WhatsApp service interruptions, message delivery failures, or Meta policy changes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="data" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Your Data &amp; Your Buyers&apos; Data</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>You are responsible for your buyers&apos; data shared through TrustShip.</li>
        <li>You must have legitimate basis for sharing buyer information (name, phone, address) with TrustShip.</li>
        <li>TrustShip stores this data securely to provide the service.</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not sell buyer or seller data to third parties.</li>
        <li>See our <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %> for full details on data handling.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="early-access-pricing" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Early Access &amp; Pricing</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>TrustShip is currently free during Early Access.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to introduce pricing at any time.</li>
        <li>We will notify all users at least 30 days before any charges apply.</li>
        <li>Early Access users will receive preferential pricing when paid plans are introduced.</li>
        <li>Continued use after pricing introduction means acceptance of new pricing terms.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="acceptable-use" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">8. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">You agree <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-800">not</strong> to use TrustShip to:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Process fraudulent or fake orders.</li>
        <li>Spam buyers with unsolicited messages.</li>
        <li>Violate Meta&apos;s WhatsApp Business policies.</li>
        <li>Sell prohibited or illegal products.</li>
        <li>Misrepresent your business or products to buyers.</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse engineer or copy TrustShip&apos;s technology.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="service-availability" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">9. Service Availability</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>TrustShip aims for high availability but does not guarantee 100% uptime.</li>
        <li>Scheduled maintenance will be communicated in advance where possible.</li>
        <li>TrustShip is not liable for losses due to service interruptions.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to modify or discontinue features at any time.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="limitation-of-liability" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>TrustShip&apos;s liability is limited to the amount paid by you in the last 3 months (currently zero during Early Access).</li>
        <li>TrustShip is not liable for indirect losses, lost revenue, RTO losses, or business disruption.</li>
        <li>TrustShip is not liable for actions of third parties including Meta or external courier partners.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="termination" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">11. Termination</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>You can delete your account at any time from dashboard settings.</li>
        <li>TrustShip can suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.</li>
        <li>On termination, your data will be retained for 90 days then permanently deleted.</li>
        <li>You can request immediate data deletion by emailing hello@trustship.in.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="changes-to-terms" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">12. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>TrustShip may update these terms from time to time.</li>
        <li>We will notify you via email at least 14 days before significant changes take effect.</li>
        <li>Continued use after changes means acceptance of new terms.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="governing-law" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">13. Governing Law</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>These terms are governed by applicable laws of the jurisdiction.</li>
        <li>Any disputes will be subject to courts in the jurisdiction of the business owner.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">14. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, contact us at hello@trustship.in
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-14 border-t border-gray-200 pt-10 print:mt-8">
    <%= link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
  </p>
</article>
